  "shortName": null,
  "description": "Indonesia Weekend Anthro Gathering (IWAG) is an annual Indonesian furry convention in the Jakarta area. It grew out of the Indonesia Winter Furmeet (IWFM), a yearly furmeet held since 2017, and the first IWAG was held December 2, 2023, at the PIC Creative Space in South Jakarta. It has no charity. Attendance grew from 140 in 2023 to 870 in 2026, with 272 fursuiters, and in 2026 the convention gained a full floor at the ibis Styles BSD City with panel rooms, a fursuit lounge, an art show and a balloon pit.",
